<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Germany</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Germany</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-ger</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:27:24Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-ger" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/s-1432?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-ger" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Leading ice hockey nations, sponsors oppose Russia's return</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f452f898a347d79cdc529c61c77b1690f79e86340d303d41db545a7a6b1f2da8</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:27:02Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T13:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/leading-ice-hockey-nations-sponsors-oppose-russia-s-return/a-79853742--b5324aaa0f6e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/leading-ice-hockey-nations-sponsors-oppose-russia-s-return/a-79853742?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Ice hockey's governing body says the impact of a court decision forcing it to reinstate Russia presents "significant practical and sporting challenges." Several leading nations say they won't play against Russian teams.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Commerce chief calls for stable US trade relations after midterms, warning that uncertainty over Trump's tariff policies remains</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bef1b7b034497f694d3bd631a044988dc391cdb6d352df84012e10bc418c8ef6</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:27:05Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T12:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-commerce-chief-calls-for-stable-us-trade-relations-after-midterms-warning-that-uncertai/live-79854127--f5c0714a5ea7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-commerce-chief-calls-for-stable-us-trade-relations-after-midterms-warning-that-uncertainty-over-trump-s-tariff-policies-remains/live-79854127?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">German business is pinning its hopes on greater stability in US trade relations after a midterm blow for Donald Trump. Meanwhile, Germany's automakers appear to be feeling less gloomy than in recent years. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>BMW reports lower Q3 earnings as China woes mount</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:30e1cefcf723c926c53250cc07dd16ad5393544f5200606cf3f8cc0a9a584e09</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:27:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T10:25:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/bmw-reports-lower-q3-earnings-as-china-woes-mount/a-79850847--9f74c40c2952.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bmw-reports-lower-q3-earnings-as-china-woes-mount/a-79850847?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">BMW reports a drop in profits in the July to September quarter amid fierce competition from China.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Ukraine in focus at Berlin Security Conference</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5d074a2075ccef0b37e559f0d9b57de236f4d6c1661bbb28a028ecf8cd4e8dd7</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:50Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T07:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-ukraine-in-focus-at-berlin-security-conference/live-79835322--417ad1cade50.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-ukraine-in-focus-at-berlin-security-conference/live-79835322?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A security conference in the German capital is addressing defending Europe against threats from Russia. Meanwhile, Germany's justice minister wants to raise penalties for sexual offenses. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany's celebrated children's author Janosch has died</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:57263e6c49cb4edfe302c1ef01f5ea38d1dd764b6cc6808449dbd3d66eb90812</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:27:24Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T10:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-s-celebrated-children-s-author-janosch-has-died/a-79851600--a3fdc8a2501b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-s-celebrated-children-s-author-janosch-has-died/a-79851600?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Bear, Tiger and Tiger-Duck: The author and illustrator Janosch achieved world fame with his heartwarming children's figures. He died at the age of 95.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine war: Merz doubts Russia is serious about a truce</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:59503ed857a4650adab6d932d3af583fdab0b5935079211139aa2cd4ab0cc789</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:50Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T15:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-war-merz-doubts-russia-is-serious-about-a-truce/a-79836026--11d120b4fdbc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-war-merz-doubts-russia-is-serious-about-a-truce/a-79836026?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">German Chancellor Friedrich Merz met with Volodymyr Zelenskyy in Berlin. Both leaders said the EU needs to be included in peace talks with Russia. Merz also expressed doubts that Russia is serious about seeking a truce.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>How Berlin's Arab queers are building their community</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f272f3c6adab7286d9660fd46ec10f66a685510521e990bd4ef1e93613d0451a</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:50Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T14:37:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-berlin-s-arab-queers-are-building-their-community/a-79833143--c676c7f349f7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-berlin-s-arab-queers-are-building-their-community/a-79833143?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As the co-founder of the ADIRA Drag Festival, Lebanese performance artist, drag performer, DJ and cultural organizer Hassandra has become an essential part of Berlin's queer artistic landscape.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>The dachshund, a humorous icon with political symbolism</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fcad094f4a9f7f57f486e175adf4a7fddc27e16b2628019f32c6322923422652</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T07:57:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/the-dachshund-a-humorous-icon-with-political-symbolism/a-79640191--0ec0144d606e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/the-dachshund-a-humorous-icon-with-political-symbolism/a-79640191?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">From Picasso to Andy Warhol, a surprising number of artists have portrayed the German breed. But the dachshund has also at times been co-opted as a political symbol.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Wagner brothers begin new NBA chapter on different paths</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c1c4a17104858ee9be801111eec1c5da027abd9daf4fc2dfb72f9d6edb16e75a</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T12:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/wagner-brothers-begin-new-nba-chapter-on-different-paths/a-79712668--ff5544415c4f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/wagner-brothers-begin-new-nba-chapter-on-different-paths/a-79712668?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After five years, brothers Franz and Moritz Wagner are no longer playing together for the Orlando Magic. In the new NBA season, their separation will likely mean the new "German" team is the Charlotte Hornets.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry></feed>
